00:20:45.661 --> 00:20:47.323
Is that a miracle or not?


00:20:55.546 --> 00:20:57.333
- Oh, my God!
- Jim, Stop!


00:20:58.883 --> 00:20:59.999
Oh, shit!


00:21:32.124 --> 00:21:33.956
From the White House,


00:21:34.043 --> 00:21:36.660
