01:00:38.552 --> 01:00:39.759
Just say it.


01:00:39.845 --> 01:00:41.461
This is because of him.


01:00:41.555 --> 01:00:42.420
Say it.


01:00:42.931 --> 01:00:43.967
Say it!


01:00:44.057 --> 01:00:48.643
We don't care what that
gentleman lover of yours


01:00:48.728 --> 01:00:50.060
does for a living.


01:00:50.147 --> 01:00:51.183
No?


01:00:51.273 --> 01:00:54.061
You might care from now
on, you motherfucker.


01:00:59.573 --> 01:01:02.782
And you better watch out, 'cause
I'm gonna tell Pablo to blow up


01:01:02.868 --> 01:01:05.110
your fucking building with
you and your family inside,


01:01:07.164 --> 01:01:09.577
And that's gonna be an
artistic decision, too!


01:01:30.854 --> 01:01:32.561
What's wrong with men?


01:01:34.274 --> 01:01:36.732
Nobody ever told you that
if you want to see a woman,


01:01:36.818 --> 01:01:38.480
you're supposed to call first?


01:01:43.450 --> 01:01:45.692
Don't show me your badge.
I accept.


01:01:48.163 --> 01:01:49.779
It's good news then.


01:01:50.790 --> 01:01:51.871
Great news.


01:01:51.958 --> 01:01:53.745
TV networks are like men...


01:01:53.835 --> 01:01:56.703
sometimes you have to
leave them to be appreciated.


01:01:59.674 --> 01:02:01.290
So, what's your plan?


01:02:02.469 --> 01:02:05.052
I have an offer from
a network in Florida.


01:02:05.138 --> 01:02:06.379
I might take it.


01:02:06.473 --> 01:02:08.339
Start a new life.


01:02:12.062 --> 01:02:14.019
But I would need a man.


01:02:18.026 --> 01:02:20.769
Are you still married,
Agent Shepard?


01:02:26.660 --> 01:02:30.279
Until you've made love
to a Colombian woman...


01:02:32.749 --> 01:02:34.615
that changes everything.


01:02:41.591 --> 01:02:44.174
Please don't put my life
in danger, Virginia.


01:02:45.595 --> 01:02:49.259
Pablo doesn't need an
excuse to kill a DEA agent.


01:02:57.065 --> 01:02:58.977
He'll take you with
him when he goes down.


01:02:59.859 --> 01:03:02.101
You know that, don't you?


01:03:05.365 --> 01:03:07.106
Virginia,


01:03:07.200 --> 01:03:11.820
you were fired by the network
and you don't have any offers.


01:03:11.913 --> 01:03:13.199
No one will hire you.


01:03:13.290 --> 01:03:16.374
Not here, not in Miami, nowhere.


01:03:16.459 --> 01:03:18.792
You're marked, right, for life.


01:03:18.878 --> 01:03:20.961
So you're gonna have to
find something else to do.


01:03:21.047 --> 01:03:22.583
Anything.


01:03:23.258 --> 01:03:25.090
And you're not 20 anymore.


01:03:26.136 --> 01:03:29.971
Your legs aren't as pretty as
they used to be, or your smile.


01:03:39.274 --> 01:03:41.266
What do you propose?


01:03:41.359 --> 01:03:42.691
Help us.


01:03:42.777 --> 01:03:43.893
In exchange for what?


01:03:43.987 --> 01:03:45.228
Protection.


01:03:45.322 --> 01:03:48.406
Protection!
There is no such thing.


01:03:49.492 --> 01:03:51.825
Pablo will find me
no matter where I go.


01:03:52.704 --> 01:03:55.071
Do you think he
doesn't scare me?


01:03:56.124 --> 01:04:00.084
You think all the threats and
death and smell of burnt flesh


01:04:00.170 --> 01:04:01.411
don't affect me?


01:04:01.504 --> 01:04:03.120
Help us find him.


01:04:10.388 --> 01:04:11.970
You know what?


01:04:14.642 --> 01:04:17.476
The TV networks only
want little girls now.


01:04:18.355 --> 01:04:21.143
They don't value the
experience of a woman.


01:04:22.484 --> 01:04:24.396
Is that what Pablo
values in you?


01:04:25.111 --> 01:04:26.602
Exactly.


01:04:26.696 --> 01:04:28.358
And my loyalty.


01:04:31.368 --> 01:04:32.734
The bill has been paid.


01:04:39.376 --> 01:04:40.492
Wait here.


01:05:13.451 --> 01:05:15.613
What all the gringos
want, Pablo, to catch you.


01:05:17.455 --> 01:05:18.912
Is he staying in Medellin?
...Are you following me?


01:05:18.998 --> 01:05:21.240
No, no, I'm not following you.
And what if I'm following you?


01:05:21.334 --> 01:05:22.870
Do you have something
to hide, Virginia?


01:05:22.961 --> 01:05:25.328
Pablo, don't follow me,
and don't call me anymore!


01:05:25.422 --> 01:05:27.709
Okay? You are ruining my life.


01:05:27.799 --> 01:05:30.132
You are ruining my life.


01:05:30.218 --> 01:05:32.710
You know that I got
fired because of you!


01:05:33.430 --> 01:05:35.422
People keep avoiding
me like the plague!


01:05:35.515 --> 01:05:37.097
Nobody will come near me!


01:05:37.183 --> 01:05:38.765
Well, that gringo have no
problem coming near you.


01:05:38.852 --> 01:05:41.219
Stop talking about
him and listen!


01:05:41.312 --> 01:05:43.725
Stay away from me!


01:05:43.815 --> 01:05:45.556
I beg you! Stay away!


01:05:45.650 --> 01:05:47.858
You're saying that because you
know they are recording this


01:05:47.944 --> 01:05:49.936
and you want them to think
it is over between us.


01:05:50.029 --> 01:05:52.521
Aahh! It is over between us!


01:05:52.615 --> 01:05:54.948
Hear it, it is over!


01:05:55.034 --> 01:05:58.323
If anyone's out there
listening, please record this!


01:05:58.413 --> 01:06:01.281
I have nothing to do
with the psychopathic killer


01:06:01.374 --> 01:06:02.364
on the other side of the line!


01:06:02.459 --> 01:06:04.701
Listen, I call you back.
I call you back.


01:06:04.794 --> 01:06:06.205
Aarghh!


01:06:09.132 --> 01:06:10.418
Do you like birds?


01:06:12.093 --> 01:06:14.380
Yes, they represent freedom.


01:06:16.931 --> 01:06:20.595
Pablo's lovers... teenage
girls from poor neighborhoods


01:06:20.685 --> 01:06:23.553
handed over by their families
for a few thousand pesos.


01:06:25.356 --> 01:06:29.020
It isn't easy sleeping with
the most wanted man in Colombia


01:06:29.110 --> 01:06:31.067
and keeping it a secret.


01:06:31.154 --> 01:06:32.520
Believe me, I know.


01:06:34.657 --> 01:06:36.694
It just takes
one of them to talk


01:06:36.784 --> 01:06:38.946
to have the
Search Bloc find him.


01:07:37.136 --> 01:07:39.048
Oh, God.


01:08:56.424 --> 01:08:58.211
Listen,
I need to reach Pablo.


01:08:58.301 --> 01:09:00.338
Our people in Miami are
getting out of line.


01:09:00.428 --> 01:09:03.171
The routes are falling apart,
and the Cali Cartel is getting


01:09:03.264 --> 01:09:05.881
our territory!
We can't finance this war


01:09:05.975 --> 01:09:08.342
if the business stops
working, you understand?


01:09:16.903 --> 01:09:18.394
I don't want you to kill them.


01:09:18.488 --> 01:09:19.649
They're our link up there.


01:09:19.739 --> 01:09:20.900
I just want you to find Pablo.


01:09:20.990 --> 01:09:22.731
Is that so difficult
to understand to you?


01:09:27.372 --> 01:09:30.240
Monje's death
meant the fall of the


01:09:30.333 --> 01:09:31.869
cartel's financial wing.


01:09:39.008 --> 01:09:42.046
Garza's death meant the
fall of the toughest wing.


01:09:54.732 --> 01:09:56.815
Pablo loses his strong men.


01:09:57.694 --> 01:10:00.186
From this point on,
he can only run.


01:10:00.738 --> 01:10:03.321
For years we have
called for peace, but the only


01:10:03.408 --> 01:10:06.025
response we've gotten has
been official and systemic


01:10:06.119 --> 01:10:09.738
persecution against our
families and organizations.


01:10:09.831 --> 01:10:13.290
KEEP HIM ON THE LINE That's why I declare
full out war on the government and the


01:10:13.376 --> 01:10:14.833
political establishment.


01:10:14.919 --> 01:10:17.411
If they make me run,
I make them run too.


01:10:17.880 --> 01:10:20.247
Terrorism is the atomic
bomb of the poor.


01:10:20.341 --> 01:10:22.128
ONE MORE MINUTE
We're not using lead anymore.


01:10:22.218 --> 01:10:25.461
From now on, we're using
dynamite, understand?


01:10:26.222 --> 01:10:30.136
And how do we know
that you are really Pablo


01:10:30.226 --> 01:10:34.641
Escobar Gaviria and not someone
else pretending to be him?


01:10:34.731 --> 01:10:36.472
That is very easy.


01:10:36.566 --> 01:10:38.933
I will prove it to you by
killing you and your family


01:10:39.026 --> 01:10:41.393
tonight, and blowing
up your radio station.


01:10:41.487 --> 01:10:43.319
What do you think?
Would that be enough?


01:10:43.406 --> 01:10:44.942
Hey!


01:10:46.242 --> 01:10:47.949
You're a celebrity
in your country, Virginia.


01:10:48.035 --> 01:10:51.199
What's so appealing about coming
to Miami to host a TV show?


01:10:53.082 --> 01:10:56.371
Well... I don't really


01:10:56.461 --> 01:10:58.748
think I have anything
else to prove in Colombia.


01:10:59.505 --> 01:11:00.666
No?


01:11:01.799 --> 01:11:07.045
But I guess what appeals
to me is the challenge,


01:11:07.138 --> 01:11:10.131
the excitement
of a new adventure.


01:11:12.518 --> 01:11:16.228
Also, there are some very
attractive men in this


01:11:16.314 --> 01:11:17.805
part of the world.


01:11:19.192 --> 01:11:21.434
Tell us, Virginia, what's
the last show you hosted on


01:11:21.527 --> 01:11:22.859
Colombian TV?


01:11:33.539 --> 01:11:34.950
How you doing?


01:11:35.041 --> 01:11:36.248
FBI.


01:11:36.334 --> 01:11:38.826
Mind if we take a
look at your passport?


01:11:46.803 --> 01:11:48.669
You carry any money?


01:11:49.305 --> 01:11:52.093
My ex isn't using
me as a mule, yet.


01:11:54.352 --> 01:11:55.468
Okay.


01:11:55.978 --> 01:11:57.810
Oh, my God!


01:12:07.365 --> 01:12:08.321
What happened?


01:12:08.407 --> 01:12:10.649
I'm sorry, they just
closed Bogota Airport.


01:12:10.743 --> 01:12:11.733
Why?


01:12:11.828 --> 01:12:12.818
I'll call you back.


01:12:12.912 --> 01:12:15.029
An Avianca plane
exploded in midflight.


01:12:28.052 --> 01:12:31.090
After the first bombs,
the country asked the government


01:12:31.180 --> 01:12:32.887
to give Pablo hell.


01:12:55.288 --> 01:12:58.247
After a dozen bombs,
the country begs the government


01:12:58.332 --> 01:13:00.790
to give Pablo what he wants.


01:13:18.561 --> 01:13:19.927
Pablo!


01:13:35.828 --> 01:13:37.194
Newell.


01:13:39.040 --> 01:13:41.407
There was a Newell in
my graduating class.


01:13:41.959 --> 01:13:43.996
You think it could be him?


01:13:44.670 --> 01:13:45.706
What is it?


01:13:45.796 --> 01:13:48.038
List of victims on
the Avianca flight.


01:13:48.633 --> 01:13:51.216
107 people on board.


01:13:51.302 --> 01:13:52.838
They just sent it.


01:13:55.181 --> 01:13:57.764
Robin Newell and
Catherine Gilmore.


01:13:57.850 --> 01:14:00.183
35, 32 years old.


01:14:00.770 --> 01:14:02.352
Married.


01:14:11.072 --> 01:14:11.858
Sir?


01:14:11.948 --> 01:14:13.359
Sir, wait.


01:14:14.659 --> 01:14:17.743
Ambassador, there were two
Americans on the Avianca flight.


01:14:17.828 --> 01:14:22.744
So, listen, directive 12.333
authorizes military operations


01:14:22.833 --> 01:14:25.166
in foreign countries to
guarantee the security of


01:14:25.252 --> 01:14:27.039
- American citizens...
- Thank you, Sarah.


01:14:27.129 --> 01:14:29.963
Agent Shepard, I'm sure
you know Mr. Velarde.


01:14:30.049 --> 01:14:32.041
He's also the man in charge
of negotiating the surrender


01:14:32.134 --> 01:14:33.466
of Pablo Escobar.


01:14:33.552 --> 01:14:35.589
This is Mr. Castro.


01:14:35.680 --> 01:14:38.468
He's Mr. Escobar's
legal representative.


01:14:40.059 --> 01:14:43.018
He's agreed to turn himself
in to the authorities.


01:14:45.022 --> 01:14:46.354
In exchange for what?


01:14:51.904 --> 01:14:54.942
By revoking the Extradition
Treaty, our judges and


01:14:55.032 --> 01:14:59.151
magistrates have taught the
world a lesson in sovereignty,


01:14:59.245 --> 01:15:01.111
independence and patriotism.


01:15:01.497 --> 01:15:03.534
After years of persecution...


01:15:54.717 --> 01:15:58.006
Pablo adds one last
condition to his surrender.


01:15:58.888 --> 01:16:00.971
He provides the prison.


01:16:05.394 --> 01:16:07.807
It is very pretty, isn't it?


01:16:17.698 --> 01:16:21.157
He cedes the property to
the municipality through a front


01:16:21.243 --> 01:16:23.576
man so they can build it there.


01:16:43.265 --> 01:16:45.097
Everyone's here
but the President.


01:16:45.184 --> 01:16:46.595
He couldn't make it.


01:16:46.685 --> 01:16:48.096
Scheduling problems.


01:16:51.774 --> 01:16:54.812
Without the threat of
extradition hanging over him


01:16:54.902 --> 01:16:57.565
Pablo needs a safe place to
reorganize his business.


01:17:01.534 --> 01:17:04.242
And the government
provides him with one.


01:17:06.122 --> 01:17:08.535
The Conception
and Norman Key routes are


01:17:08.624 --> 01:17:12.334
working again. The Fany is
at almost one hundred percent.


01:17:12.419 --> 01:17:15.787
We have 250 planes in service


01:17:15.881 --> 01:17:18.965
and 30 Pipers still
immobilized in Santamarca.


01:17:19.051 --> 01:17:22.886
Are you talking to the number
two at the Aviation Authority?


01:17:22.972 --> 01:17:25.089
Talk to him, he's a brother.
If he doesn't want to play


01:17:25.182 --> 01:17:27.094
ball you bring him
here and I talk to him.


01:17:31.021 --> 01:17:35.516
So, for everyone who is still
outside nobody moves a gram


01:17:35.609 --> 01:17:37.225
without me knowing it.


01:17:37.319 --> 01:17:39.106
Nobody. Understood?


01:17:39.196 --> 01:17:42.610
They have to pay the
taxes that they owe me.


01:17:42.700 --> 01:17:43.781
That's 20 percent.


01:17:43.868 --> 01:17:46.076
...20 percent?
...20 percent.


01:17:46.162 --> 01:17:48.074
They won't like that, Pablo.


01:17:48.164 --> 01:17:50.372
The Cali people are
asking for five percent.


01:17:50.457 --> 01:17:53.495
Jesus, everyone will
go to them and that's OK.


01:17:53.586 --> 01:17:56.169
How do you know that?
Have you talked to them?


01:18:07.850 --> 01:18:10.593
You prefer those
pussies from Cali,


01:18:10.686 --> 01:18:12.268
go to them and try your luck.


01:18:12.354 --> 01:18:16.064
I came up with the routes, I
took out extradition all by


01:18:16.150 --> 01:18:17.812
myself so you can keep working.


01:18:17.902 --> 01:18:20.895
So make everybody knows that the
one who hasn't paid with cash,


01:18:20.988 --> 01:18:23.401
merchandise or properties
will pay with his life.


01:18:29.413 --> 01:18:30.449
What's next?


01:18:32.541 --> 01:18:35.204
Soccer players from the
professional league come to


01:18:35.294 --> 01:18:36.910
play with the traffickers.


01:18:48.432 --> 01:18:51.596
And the match isn't
over until the Patr贸n wins.


01:18:59.151 --> 01:19:02.189
The social workers have arrived!


01:19:41.235 --> 01:19:43.522
Sundays are
saved for family.


01:20:09.471 --> 01:20:12.305
Why don't you
live at home with us, Daddy?


01:20:14.560 --> 01:20:17.143
Because I work here, Princess.


01:20:17.855 --> 01:20:20.063
My princess.


01:20:22.401 --> 01:20:24.768
This is my castle. I...


01:20:25.654 --> 01:20:27.862
Do you see those
towers there?


01:20:27.948 --> 01:20:29.314
Those are my towers.


01:20:30.200 --> 01:20:32.817
I am a king, and
king has castles.


01:20:34.371 --> 01:20:37.614
And that's why
you are a princess,


01:20:37.708 --> 01:20:39.119
because you are my daughter.


01:20:39.752 --> 01:20:40.959
But there are guards.


01:20:41.045 --> 01:20:42.786
Yes, of course there are.


01:20:42.880 --> 01:20:44.587
They are here to protect me.


01:20:46.759 --> 01:20:50.469
Mommy says you can't leave,
and she cries all the time.


01:20:51.347 --> 01:20:53.839
What do you mean I can't leave?


01:20:55.601 --> 01:20:56.717
Who says that?


01:20:56.810 --> 01:20:57.926
Mommy.


01:21:02.775 --> 01:21:06.485
This is my castle.
I can come and go as I please.


01:21:11.200 --> 01:21:12.736
You wanna see that?


01:21:12.826 --> 01:21:16.069
You want to go out
for an ice cream?


01:21:17.331 --> 01:21:22.247
Where is the place that the
big park near the church.


01:21:22.336 --> 01:21:23.918
That's the one you like.


01:21:25.964 --> 01:21:27.375
Let's go.


01:21:27.841 --> 01:21:29.503
Let's go.


01:21:33.889 --> 01:21:35.380
What did you have for lunch?


01:21:36.058 --> 01:21:37.640
Good Lord.


01:21:41.897 --> 01:21:43.058
Don't wait for us.


01:21:43.148 --> 01:21:45.561
Manuela and I are going
out for an ice cream.


01:21:45.651 --> 01:21:47.938
Pablito still has
his sense of humor.


01:22:01.250 --> 01:22:03.492
Who's in charge of this castle?


01:22:04.128 --> 01:22:05.744
Who's the boss here?


01:22:06.422 --> 01:22:07.458
You, Patr贸n.


01:22:07.548 --> 01:22:09.756
Yeah, that's what I like
to hear. Open the door.


01:22:09.842 --> 01:22:11.208
Open the door!


01:22:12.136 --> 01:22:13.672
Open it.


01:22:19.017 --> 01:22:21.851
The king and his princess are
going out for an ice cream.


01:22:21.937 --> 01:22:23.849
What flavor you want?
...Strawberry!


01:22:23.939 --> 01:22:27.103
Strawberry!
The princess has a craving!


01:22:27.776 --> 01:22:30.564
If you dare to stop us, the
king will cut your heads off.


01:22:30.654 --> 01:22:32.361
Open the door.
Open the door.


01:22:41.540 --> 01:22:42.576
Our carriage is waiting for us.


01:22:44.418 --> 01:22:45.078
Give me the keys.


01:22:45.669 --> 01:22:47.160
Give me the keys, man.


01:22:47.254 --> 01:22:49.667
The king is asking for
the keys of the car.


01:22:49.756 --> 01:22:51.497
Give me the keys.
Give me the keys, man!


01:23:13.530 --> 01:23:15.066
Pablo!


01:23:19.578 --> 01:23:20.568
Pablo!


01:23:40.307 --> 01:23:43.425
I forgot to tell you,
my princess, that...


01:23:44.561 --> 01:23:47.599
I made them bring
the best ice cream,


01:23:47.689 --> 01:23:51.683
strawberry ice cream
of the world here for you.


01:23:54.238 --> 01:23:57.857
Strawberry ice cream just made
with ice from the North Pole


01:23:57.950 --> 01:24:01.318
which is especially for
my daughter my princess,


01:24:01.411 --> 01:24:02.697
especially!


01:24:02.788 --> 01:24:04.404
The best one in the world!


01:24:04.498 --> 01:24:05.739
For you.


01:24:05.832 --> 01:24:06.913
Really?


01:24:08.585 --> 01:24:11.123
Have you heard of the strawberry
icebergs in the North Pole?


01:24:11.213 --> 01:24:12.249
They're very famous.


01:24:12.339 --> 01:24:14.797
Not only has
the media banned me.


01:24:14.883 --> 01:24:18.627
My advertising contracts are
also cancelled which forces me


01:24:18.720 --> 01:24:21.212
to sell my home to pay my debts.


01:24:22.099 --> 01:24:23.215
Be careful with that!


01:24:24.017 --> 01:24:27.226
What you just moved with your
foot is a very expensive piece


01:24:27.312 --> 01:24:28.928
of Indonesian art.


01:24:29.022 --> 01:24:31.435
I'm not asking you
to use your head.


01:24:31.942 --> 01:24:34.150
Using your hands will be enough.


01:24:35.821 --> 01:24:38.905
I rent an apartment at El
Nogal where a former First Lady


01:24:38.991 --> 01:24:42.780
lives, hoping her bodyguards
will keep an eye on me as well.


01:24:44.871 --> 01:24:46.157
How are you boys?


01:24:46.999 --> 01:24:48.786
Fine, thanks.


