01:47:21.435 --> 01:47:24.519
Don't call here anymore, mister.
This place is full of cops...


01:47:24.605 --> 01:47:25.766
Victoria, don't
tell me what to do.


01:47:25.856 --> 01:47:27.267
No, no, no, don't
tell me what to do.


01:47:27.358 --> 01:47:28.269
Nobody ask you.


01:47:28.359 --> 01:47:30.601
Yes, yes, keep Manuela nearby.


01:47:56.470 --> 01:47:57.210
Stay calm, Patr贸n.


