Go check. Go check.


01:48:06.188 --> 01:48:07.349
Hold on.


01:48:15.864 --> 01:48:18.231
The previous moment
to something happening


01:48:18.325 --> 01:48:20.908
is always the best moment.


01:48:22.579 --> 01:48:25.492
Like when you are waiting
for the nnan you love


01:48:25.582 --> 01:48:28.120
or when you are about
to open a present.


01:48:32.715 --> 01:48:35.674
The fishermen from the
coast of Colombia


01:48:35.759 --> 01:48:38.547
say that what really
matters is the wait.


01:48:40.305 --> 01:48:44.174
Feeling the sea breeze on your
face, the salt on your lips.


01:48:47.104 --> 01:48:51.018
Imagining that little fish
fucker approaching the bait.


01:48:53.694 --> 01:48:56.858
He wants to bite it,
but he thinks it over.


01:49:03.871 --> 01:49:06.409
But if the bait is good enough,


01:49:06.957 --> 01:49:09.324
the fish will
eventually bite it.


01:49:14.423 --> 01:49:17.257
Even when he knows
there is a hook inside...


01:49:23.766 --> 01:49:25.132
he'll bite.


01:49:44.828 --> 01:49:45.944
Call!


01:49:47.664 --> 01:49:48.745
Daddy?


01:49:49.750 --> 01:49:51.537
Manuela.


01:49:53.170 --> 01:49:55.878
