be in the show.


01:49:58.675 --> 01:50:00.041
Mommy's wrong.


01:50:00.135 --> 01:50:03.503
Mommy's saying that because
she wants it to be a surprise.


01:50:03.597 --> 01:50:06.010
Don't tell her that
I told you that.


01:50:06.850 --> 01:50:08.512
I'm getting a signal.


01:50:09.436 --> 01:50:12.019
Somewhere in Los Olivos,
between 80 and 90th.


01:50:12.106 --> 01:50:13.813
Los Olivos, 80 and 90th.


01:50:21.240 --> 01:50:23.072
And you have your dress ready?


01:50:23.158 --> 01:50:24.899
