01:53:40.314 --> 01:53:41.179
Dad?


01:55:14.991 --> 01:55:17.904
Long live Colombia!


01:55:18.995 --> 01:55:21.328
Long live Colombia!


01:55:21.415 --> 01:55:23.532
Long live Colombia!


01:55:23.917 --> 01:55:27.911
Long live Colombia!
Long live Colombia!


01:55:32.217 --> 01:55:35.335
...Long live Colombia!
